// Authored for the def writers' corpus legs (fixtures/README.md): one block per kind of record
// JO:CA's items.def and its jox01 expansion's hold, together using every key the two files use,
// in each of the forms they write a key's values in (tab and blank runs, a key's case, a
// trailing blank, negative and leading-zero whole numbers, reals spelled 1.5 / 2.50 / .75),
// and the lines the game reads nothing of: an attrib: line with no word and with a word the
// table lacks (exp1, exp11, forceasset, neutral, pilotonly, lfp, noctool, pfoil, fo), a subtype
// on a building, an effect's volume and offset, an addeweapG placeholder tail, a name past the
// game's cut. No value here is shipped data.


begin "Corpus Drivable Tank"
